[2026-03-21T16:18:03.392Z] [STEP 4] text: Interesting! Let me re-analyze the errors based on the actual voucher data:

**Error 1 (Voucher #27):** "Telefonkostnad" posted to 6860 (Møte, kurs) instead of 6590 (Annet driftsmateriale). amountGross=6200, with MVA. Correction: credit 6860 (reverse), debit 6590 (correct), both with vatType 1 (high MVA).

